<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <title>A park name was changed</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica; color: #1a1a1a">
  <%- include("includes/header.ejs") %>

  <p style="font-size: 16pt">
    A park name was changed by an automated sync with the Park Names Data Register.
  </p>

  <p style="font-size:14pt;margin-bottom:8px;">
    <strong>Old Name:</strong>
    <%= oldName %>
  </p>

  <p style="font-size:14pt;margin-bottom:8px;">
    <strong>New Name:</strong>
    <%= newName %>
  </p>

  <p>
    The protectedAreaName field in Strapi has already been updated to reflect this change, but there may be other instances of the name in Strapi that require manual updating.
    Please manually review and update the following data for this park:
  </p>

  &#x25A2; Descriptions and other rich text editor fields<br />
  &#x25A2; Slug fields <i>(if you change a slug make sure you create a redirect)</i><br />
  &#x25A2; Park activity descriptions<br />
  &#x25A2; Park facility descriptions<br />
  &#x25A2; Park name types not supported by the data register <i>(historic, escaped, basic)</i><br />
  &#x25A2; Park operation notes<br />
  &#x25A2; Park operation subarea notes<br />
  &#x25A2; Park photos<br />
  &#x25A2; Park subpages<br />
  &#x25A2; Park sites<br />
  &#x25A2; Management plans<br />
  &#x25A2; Any changes made on the website must be reflected in the latest version of the relevant draft document or documents.<br />
  &#x25A2; Check the park page content, with special attention to the &lsquo;History&rsquo; section.<br />
  &#x25A2; Do a site-wide scan for other references to the old park name and update where appropriate.<br />

  <p>
    Check the <a href="https://apps.nrs.gov.bc.ca/int/confluence/spaces/BCPRS/overview">Confluence page</a> for guidance on this task.
  </p>
</body>

</html>